<?php
/**
 * Secomm Launchpad — Quick View modal (TASK-Z3DAH5, SLP-157)
 *
 * Single reusable modal for the product list. Renders a native <dialog> per the
 * Hyvä UI modal.A-simple pattern; product data is lazy-loaded via GraphQL when a
 * card dispatches the `open-quickview` window event. Add to cart posts to the core
 * `checkout/cart/add` controller with the AJAX header so the session quote stays
 * authoritative (see record §Approach for the GraphQL rejection rationale).
 *
 * @var Template $block
 * @var Escaper $escaper
 * @var ViewModelRegistry $viewModels
 */

